    <string name="meter_disclaimer">This is an ESTIMATE — the final bill is always the one on the LESCO/PITC website.</string>
    <string name="meter_why_andaza_q">Why is this an ESTIMATE?</string>
    <string name="meter_why_andaza_a">The actual bill is made by LESCO — FPA changes every month and the reading date can differ. Our estimate applies your previous bill\'s ACTUAL charges (FPA, taxes, fixed charges) to your new reading: only lines that were in your previous bill are included, nothing is made up. Old arrears, late fee and installments are not included. The final bill is always the one on the LESCO/PITC website.</string>
